# Exported health data. The app names its own backups predictably, so an export
# that lands in the project folder can never be committed by accident. These are
# readings — the one thing in this system that must never reach a remote.
bp-tracker-backup-*.json
bp-tracker-all-*.csv
*.bp-backup.json
